cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CellQuorum in your research, please cite it as below."
title: CellQuorum
abstract: >-
  A publication-grade, config-driven single-cell RNA-seq workflow engine with
  Python, R/Bioconductor, and GPU backends. A single validated configuration
  file and one command run a provenance-tracked analysis spanning quality
  control, integration, annotation, differential expression and abundance,
  enrichment, gene-regulatory networks, cell-cell communication, and trajectory
  inference.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: AJ
    family-names: Book
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/SecondBook5/cellquorum"
url: "https://github.com/SecondBook5/cellquorum"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - scRNA-seq
  - anndata
  - scanpy
  - bioinformatics
  - workflow
  - bioconductor
  - reproducibility
  - gpu
